  !>     \brief  BLAS Level 2 API
  !>
  !>     \details
  !>     herBatched performs the matrix-vector operations:
  !>
  !>         A_i := A_i + alpha*x_i*x_i**H
  !>
  !>     where ``alpha`` is a real scalar, ``x_i`` is a vector, and ``A_i`` is an
  !>     ``n`` by ``n`` symmetric matrix, for ``i`` = 1, ..., ``batchCount``.
  !>
