  !>               is supplied in AP.
  !>               - HIPBLAS_FILL_MODE_LOWER: the lower triangular part of each Hermitian matrix A_i
  !>               is supplied in AP.
  !>     @param[in]
  !>     n         [int]
  !>               the order of each matrix A_i.
