  !>
  !>         y := alpha*A*x + beta*y,
  !>
  !>     where ``alpha`` and ``beta`` are scalars, ``x`` and ``y`` are ``n``-element vectors, and
  !>     ``A`` should contain an upper or lower triangular ``n`` by ``n`` symmetric banded matrix.
  !>
